WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.746 --> 00:00:02.550
(Marial sighs)

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.420
- What?

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.410
- Your mother is on her way here.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.994
A rider, she's less than an hour away.

00:00:07.994 --> 00:00:09.616
- Mother? Huzzah!

00:00:09.616 --> 00:00:13.199
(excited orchestral music)

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:21.816
Ooh!

00:00:21.816 --> 00:00:25.649
(Catherine breathing heavily)

00:00:27.604 --> 00:00:30.443
(Catherine squeals)

00:00:30.443 --> 00:00:31.613
- Bubble, bubble.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.000
Bubble, bubble.

00:00:34.873 --> 00:00:36.043
Bubble, bubble.

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:41.081
Pop!
(Catherine screams)

00:00:41.081 --> 00:00:42.498
Oh, my Catherine.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.002
My dear one.

00:00:46.438 --> 00:00:47.430
- Oh, sorry, I just-

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:50.807
- Needed your mother and
found an empty space.

00:00:50.807 --> 00:00:51.640
Mm.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.123
Come, the space is empty no more.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.970
Now, young lady,

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:59.120
there is a rumor sweeping Europe

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:02.050
that you have taken
Russia from your husband.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:02.920
- Guard.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:03.753
- Yes, Empress.

00:01:03.753 --> 00:01:05.500
- Who's the leader of Russia?

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.779
- Yes are, Empress.

00:01:06.779 --> 00:01:08.001
(Catherine laughs)
Huzzah!

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:08.956
- Huzzah!

00:01:08.956 --> 00:01:10.260
- What is huzzah?

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:13.030
- Huzzah. It's a lot of things.

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:14.860
All purposes, variously.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:17.247
Also, you notice, I am pregnant!

00:01:17.247 --> 00:01:19.280
- Oh, I had hoped that's what it was.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:21.710
Russians can be quite fat. (chuckles)

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:23.840
I had feared you'd turned native.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.750
For a mother who set her heart

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:29.723
on marrying her four
daughters to kings of Europe,

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:33.980
(sighs) and no one would
believe it when I said I would,

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:35.610
they thought it madness.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:36.950
- But you always saw it.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:38.950
- And then to have done it.

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:43.753
And for the final one to be
France, the jewel of Europe.

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:45.543
And then.

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:47.810
- And then?

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:52.740
- And then you overthrew your husband

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.333
and the deal was off.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.320
No one wants to risk a rebellion

00:01:58.320 --> 00:01:59.893
from inside the marriage bed.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.180
- I'm-
- Sorry?

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.880
Speechless?

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:06.080
Which?

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:07.610
Either would be fabulous.

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:10.720
Both would be appropriate.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:11.553
- Sorry.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:13.933
- You are who you are.

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:15.783
Always were.

00:02:17.217 --> 00:02:21.400
And I love you for your
crazy mind and willful ways.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:27.550
But you have cost your sister
greatly with this whim.

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:30.180
- This is not a whim. It is my destiny.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.830
- We were talking of your sister.

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:34.513
- Yes, I'm sorry. Yes.

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:37.343
- I will have to make a new plan.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:40.110
It will be difficult now.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:43.480
- I do not wish us to
misunderstand each other.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.290
I love your daughter. I am on her side.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.160
- Oh, I thought you were on Russia's side.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:51.240
- They are the same. She is Russia.

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:55.850
- She is a child with
a dazzling intelligence

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:59.630
and a dizzying belief
in the power of herself.

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:02.150
And if she is being duped into using these

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:05.840
to put herself in grave danger
at the behest of others,

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:09.460
then those people are no friends of mine.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.293
- I assure you-

00:03:10.293 --> 00:03:11.968
- I am sure you do.

00:03:11.968 --> 00:03:12.863
(butterfly crunches)
Oh.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:14.693
Poor Sergei.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.293
He is unwell.

00:03:18.286 --> 00:03:21.352
(Joanna exhales sharply)

00:03:21.352 --> 00:03:23.935
(gentle music)

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:30.877
I don't find you interminable.

00:03:35.574 --> 00:03:37.324
I find you thrilling.

00:03:38.235 --> 00:03:39.493
- Ah.

00:03:39.493 --> 00:03:42.076
(Peter groans)

00:03:52.029 --> 00:03:53.220
- Mother, are you all right?

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:54.323
I'm mortified.

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:57.553
- I thought that was it for a moment.

00:03:57.553 --> 00:03:58.840
I thought you'd killed me.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.700
- Don't say that!

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:01.533
I'm sorry.

00:04:02.415 --> 00:04:03.265
- I need to rest.

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:10.093
There's a list of
everyone you should kill.

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:14.460
- Mother, they fought for me.

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.427
- You don't know what they fought for.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.040
- It's funny, I was just thinking,

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:23.762
sometimes I miss my mother.

00:04:23.762 --> 00:04:24.595
- Hmm.

00:04:24.595 --> 00:04:25.930
- Her being dead at an early age

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.620
and sometimes I'm glad she's dead,

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:33.280
as I have lived my own
life on my own terms.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:34.310
- Subtle.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:35.480
- What are you?

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.830
- We have some concerns.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:41.580
Seeing you with your mother,
you are not quite yourself.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:43.613
- We worry what she does to you.

00:04:43.613 --> 00:04:46.980
- You mean beside love me
beyond any human on this earth?

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:49.890
Care for me and my sisters
like we are precious gems?

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:50.723
Make a home for us

00:04:50.723 --> 00:04:53.683
and ignite a fire in us to
be the special ones we are?

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:59.590
- She perhaps does not
understand us is our point.

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:01.420
- We worry she wants us dead.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.863
- Oh, she did give me a
list and you were on it.

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:08.213
- Oh. I'm first.

00:05:09.049 --> 00:05:11.300
- Oh, relax.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:12.970
She has always wanted people dead.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:15.630
For months once, she plotted
the death of our neighbor Hess

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:18.790
as he had eyed Donna in a
way she had found disturbing.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.040
We would gather 'round
with tea and kugelhopf

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.460
and we would all have to think of ways

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.860
we would kill him and get away with it.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.473
- Fun game. We'd just play chess.

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:31.010
- Ladies, you may all go.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:33.730
But I thank you for the
insight into your lives.

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:35.380
It has inspired me.

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:36.560
- Why are you getting up?

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.010
- I need paper.

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:40.720
- Darling, what are you doing?

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.380
- She has that look.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:43.620
What do you need?

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:45.050
- I will set up in here.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:48.984
Marial, get me the current
legal codes regarding women and-

00:05:48.984 --> 00:05:50.230
- What are you talking about?

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:54.710
- Think of it, a woman with
the right to divorce a man.

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:56.700
- Think of the freedom
that would give women

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:59.030
who suffer violence, drunkenness,

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:02.591
men rutting on them while
sweating and smelling of cheese.

00:06:02.591 --> 00:06:03.424
(Elizabeth inhales sharply)

00:06:03.424 --> 00:06:06.760
It would change the very
dynamics between men and women.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.990
Also, women as property, that must stop.

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:11.350
- Oh!
- You must stop this.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.020
It is a delirium.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.660
- Is that not exciting?

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.970
To change the systems women live by,

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:19.410
take power from men and give it to us.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:22.090
- It is easy to take power from men,

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.690
and sometimes they even enjoy it,

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:27.380
but what you must not do
is advertise about it,

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:29.360
for then their fists come out.

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:31.650
Someone tried to kill you, darling.

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:32.750
- I'm dealing with it.

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.180
It's part of the job.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:39.193
- And you will die if we
don't change the game.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:41.870
And we can.

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:42.703
- What?

00:06:42.703 --> 00:06:46.080
- In three days time,
you will have this baby

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.433
and there is a natural pause.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:56.110
You transition out of
power and into motherhood

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:59.860
and Peter transitions back in,

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:04.050
and it can addressed through
Europe as some strange rumor

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:08.103
and I can get your sister
the French job back.

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:10.980
- What?

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:13.713
- It could all be just as I planned.

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:16.833
And you can be safe.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.463
Darling, you can play that boy.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:25.923
We both can. Trust me.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:31.023
You're staring at me blankly.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:35.563
- I'm just a piece in
your perfect tableau.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.500
The maestro of marriage.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:42.823
- You were born to be a royal wife.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:47.143
You were trained to be a royal wife.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:53.780
Be one and stop this and live.

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:57.920
Darling, your sisters
can do it, why can't you?

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.843
- Because I am not them. I'm better.

00:08:00.843 --> 00:08:01.676
(hand slaps)

00:08:01.676 --> 00:08:02.509
Oh!

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:04.470
Oh.

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:05.830
- Darling.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.740
See, it's crazy statements like that

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:10.743
that make me worry
about your mental state.

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:14.960
- Recognize who and what I am or leave.

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:17.890
- Recognize that you are mad.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.090
And you need help.

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:22.740
And I am here to give it.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:24.540
- Get out of my palace.

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:25.570
- Catherine.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.063
- Get out of my country.

00:08:29.019 --> 00:08:29.852
(dramatic music)

00:08:29.852 --> 00:08:30.685
Go!

00:08:31.896 --> 00:08:33.479
- Chew, little Cat.

00:08:34.789 --> 00:08:35.973
Chew, chew, chew.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:41.079
But I will not stick
around while you choke.

00:08:41.079 --> 00:08:43.829
(dramatic music)

00:08:48.399 --> 00:08:51.149
(dramatic music)

